B.JA={Sobre:0,Habilidades:1,Projetos:2,Contato:3,Certificados:4,"Ir para a se\xe7\xe3o Sobre":5,"Ir para a se\xe7\xe3o Habilidades":6,"Ir para a se\xe7\xe3o Projetos":7,"Ir para a se\xe7\xe3o Contato":8,"Abrir certifica\xe7\xf5es no LinkedIn":9,"Conecte-se Comigo":10,"Abrir menu de navega\xe7\xe3o":11,"Selecionar idioma":12,"Portugu\xeas (Brasil)":13,"Ingl\xeas (EUA)":14,"SOBRE MIM":15,HABILIDADES:16,PROJETOS:17,[u.Z]:18,[u.E]:19,[u.b]:20,[u.p]:21,"Desenvolvedor Flutter S\xeanior":22,[u.X]:23,"Ver mais e ir para a se\xe7\xe3o de projetos":24,"Ver projetos":25,"Abrir perfil no GitHub em uma nova aba":26,"Abrir perfil no LinkedIn em uma nova aba":27,"Foto de Caio Calado de Ara\xfajo":28,"anos com Flutter":29,"redes atendidas":30,"sistemas unificados":31,"Sou desenvolvedor Flutter S\xeanior, com ":32,"mais de 6 anos de experi\xeancia":33,[u.y]:34,"mais de 10 redes de cl\xednicas":35,[u.C]:36,"3 sistemas legados":37,[u.G]:38,"VAMOS CONVERSAR?":39,"Tem um projeto interessante?":40,"Abrir ":41,"Ver detalhes":42,"Reposit\xf3rio":43,"Ver case":44,"Contexto e desafio":45,"Solu\xe7\xe3o":46,Impacto:47,Tecnologias:48,Fechar:49,"Mobile & Frontend":50,[u.l]:51,"Backend & Dashboards":52,[u.O]:53,"Dados & Cloud":54,[u.k]:55,"Publica\xe7\xe3o & Ferramentas":56,[u.a]:57,"Digitaliza\xe7\xe3o e Unifica\xe7\xe3o de Processos":58,"Desenvolvimento Mobile Flutter":59,"Gest\xe3o \xc1gil e Lideran\xe7a":60,"Desenvolvimento Cross-Platform":61,"Arquitetura & Engenharia":62,"Publica\xe7\xe3o & DevOps Mobile":63,"UI/UX Design & Prototipagem":64,"Teatec \u2014 Amigo Tech & Cl\xednica Mundos":65,[u.N]:66,[u.M]:67,[u.H]:68,[u.D]:69,[u.w]:70,"App Corporativo \u2014 Cl\xednica Mundos":71,[u.n]:72,[u.m]:73,[u.z]:74,[u.F]:75,[u.R]:76,[u.B]:77,[u.f]:78,[u.L]:79,[u.Y]:80,[u.u]:81,[u.x]:82,"Este portf\xf3lio":83,[u._]:84,[u.I]:85,"N\xe3o foi poss\xedvel abrir o link":86,[u.s]:87,[u.v]:88,"Abrir refer\xeancia sobre ":89,Claro:90,Escuro:91,Sistema:92,Tema:93,"Selecionar tema":94,"Abrir op\xe7\xf5es de tema":95,"Tema atual: ":96,Ok:97,"Digitaliza\xe7\xe3o de processos":98,Algoritmos:99,"Estruturas de dados":100,"Nov/2024 \u2013 Mai/2026":101,"Fev/2020 \u2013 Nov/2024":102}
B.fI=new A.bO(B.JA,["About","Skills","Projects","Contact","Certificates","Go to the About section","Go to the Skills section","Go to the Projects section","Go to the Contact section","Open certifications on LinkedIn","Connect with me","Open navigation menu","Select language","Portuguese (Brazil)","English (US)","ABOUT ME","SKILLS","PROJECTS","Technologies, languages, frameworks, and tools I master and use every day.","Case studies presented through the problem, process, decisions, and outcome\u2014not just the code.","I turn complex processes into digital products that are simple to use.","SENIOR FLUTTER DEVELOPER \xb7 MOBILE & WEB","Senior Flutter Developer","I work with Flutter on mobile and web products, from architecture to interface, connecting real business needs with clear and reliable experiences.","See more and go to the Projects section","View projects","Open GitHub profile in a new tab","Open LinkedIn profile in a new tab","Photo of Caio Calado de Ara\xfajo","years with Flutter","clinic networks served","systems unified","I am a Senior Flutter Developer with ","over 6 years of experience"," building mobile and web applications. At TiTa Therapy, I built and maintained a platform used daily by ","more than 10 clinic networks",". At Amigo Tech / Cl\xednica Mundos, I collaborated on Teatech to digitize processes and unify ","3 legacy systems",". I also work with reactive architecture, REST API integration, app store releases, and agile project management.","LET'S TALK","Have an interesting project?","Open ","View details","Repository","View case","Context and challenge","Solution","Impact","Technologies","Close","Mobile & Frontend","Cross-platform development and modern interfaces","Backend & Dashboards","Servers, APIs, and admin dashboards","Data & Cloud","Storage, authentication, and cloud infrastructure","Delivery & Tools","Version control, CI/CD, and development tools","Process Digitization and Unification","Flutter Mobile Development","Agile Management and Leadership","Cross-Platform Development","Architecture & Engineering","Mobile Release & DevOps","UI/UX Design & Prototyping","Teatec \u2014 Amigo Tech & Cl\xednica Mundos","Web platform to digitize processes and unify Cl\xednica Mundos systems.","While working with Amigo Tech and Cl\xednica Mundos, I contributed to Teatec, migrating paper processes and consolidating 3 legacy systems into one solution. This unification sped up the clinic\u2019s reports and metrics.","Paper processes and information spread across three legacy systems made operations and reporting difficult.","Contributed to a web platform that centralized the systems and digitized clinic processes.","Centralization sped up reporting and metrics for Cl\xednica Mundos.","Corporate App \u2014 Cl\xednica Mundos","Mobile app for branch offices integrated with the Teatech platform.","At Amigo Tech / Cl\xednica Mundos, I built and implemented mobile features for the corporate app used by branch offices. It integrates with Teatech through REST APIs, using GetX for state management and navigation.","Cross-platform platform for therapy clinic networks.","Built and maintained the startup\u2019s main mobile and web platform, used daily by more than 10 clinic networks and their branches. Reactive architecture with MobX and Provider, REST API integration, and releases on Google Play and the App Store.","Maintain a care platform used daily by multiple clinic networks on mobile and web.","Built and maintained the cross-platform Flutter product with reactive architecture, REST integration, and app store release workflows.","The platform served more than 10 clinic networks and their branches.","Programming lab focused on algorithms, data structures, and Dart performance.","A software engineering research and practice environment in the Dart ecosystem, with advanced algorithm implementations and optimized data structures.","Technical documentation platform organizing courses, learnings, and best practices.","Scalable production documentation for cataloging courses, learnings, development notes, and best practices. Versioning follows GitOps concepts.","This portfolio","Responsive professional portfolio bringing together career history, projects, and impact metrics.","Responsive web app built to bring together professional history, projects, and outcomes, with continuous publishing through GitHub Pages.","Unable to open link","Check your internet connection and try again.","\u201cThe art of making the complex feel easy from the very first click.\u201d","Open reference for ","Light","Dark","System","Theme","Select theme","Open theme options","Current theme: ","OK","Process digitization","Algorithms","Data structures","Nov 2024 \u2013 May 2026","Feb 2020 \u2013 Nov 2024"],t.li)
